{"4025270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sancta", "steam_appid": 4025270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025270/extras/ea62ceb96628d0e5e5b0fd59bfb74c17.avif?t=1780916494\" width=1280 height=342 /></span><strong>About the Gam</strong>e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sancta is not about endless hours of gameplay – it’s about delivering one powerful experience that keeps you engaged for an entire evening, like a dark film you live through yourself. It’s about intensity, emotion, and immersion rather than quantity, leaving you with a lasting memory long after the game is over.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Step into the darkness of an abandoned dungeon, where light means survival and every step could be your last. Sancta is a dark, atmospheric experience that traps you in a long-forgotten underground world, where the story is revealed through environmental details, shadows, and echoes of the past.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unnamed protagonist finds themselves imprisoned deep beneath the earth, where reality intertwines with fear and madness. To survive, you must craft your own torch, protect it as your most precious possession, and seek refuge where you can rest, if only for a moment. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemies and Surv</strong>ival </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies lurking in the dark are neither weak nor defeat-able. The only hope lies in stealth, hiding, and fleeing. Every item you find has value but is also fragile – nothing lasts forever. Mental resilience is as important as health and strength. The more fear your character experiences, the less they can craft, trade, and survive. Sancta is not just a game about escape. It’s a story about the will to survive, where darkness never sleeps. Explore a world shaped by light, shadow, and sound. Solve puzzles, hide from relentless enemies, and interact with a fragile, living environment where every step matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025270/extras/ac68de1d30388888fd13daa973dd892a.avif?t=1780916494\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Experien</strong>ce </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From crafting your first torch to finding safe places to rest – every step tests your foresight and resilience. Fragile items, mental endurance, and careful planning guide you through a tense and terrifying experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed in Unreal Engine 5, Sancta delivers a visually striking, atmospheric experience that fully immerses players in a claustrophobic and intense underground adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025270/extras/05fba47230a5c21c29939a4478837214.avif?t=1780916494\" width=1336 height=300 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025270/extras/b50fd05ee07137d057194e3dc3493479.poster.avif?t=1780916494\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025270/extras/b50fd05ee07137d057194e3dc3493479.webm?t=1780916494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025270/extras/b50fd05ee07137d057194e3dc3493479.mp4?t=1780916494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app